WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:00.983
- Oh, no.

00:00:00.983 --> 00:00:02.870
Why is he appearing while in surgery?

00:00:02.870 --> 00:00:04.800
And how did he get this laptop in there?

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:05.960
- Hello, Mr. Green?

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:07.700
- So it seems that
appearing in court as a cat

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:09.140
is not the worst thing that you can do

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:11.190
if you have a telephonic court appearance.

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:12.960
This doctor appeared in court

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:14.980
while actually in surgery, let's watch.

00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:15.830
- It kind of looks like you're

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:17.460
in an operating room right now.

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:18.293
- I am, sir.

00:00:18.293 --> 00:00:19.126
I'm in an operating room.

00:00:19.126 --> 00:00:20.750
Yes, I'm available for
trial. Go right ahead.

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:23.640
- No, you're not available if
you're actually in surgery.

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:25.850
- So unless I'm mistaken,

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:27.740
I'm seeing a defendant
that's in the middle

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:32.310
of an operating room appearing
to be actively engaged

00:00:32.310 --> 00:00:34.820
in providing services to a patient.

00:00:34.820 --> 00:00:36.940
Is that correct, Mr. Green?

00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:37.989
- Yes, sir.

00:00:37.989 --> 00:00:38.830
- I mean, the judge to his credit,

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:40.790
is handling this with poise.

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:42.730
You should give the court the respect,

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:44.730
but also, you should give
your patients respect.

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:46.020
This might be a HIPAA violation

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:48.690
if you didn't get consent to
videotape while in surgery.

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.870
And also, you're endangering
a patient's life.

00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:51.860
And it's all recorded!

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:53.610
This is total insanity!

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:56.640
I wouldn't be surprised if
this patient saw him in court.

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:59.390
Just like I'll see you in
court if you don't subscribe.

